OL,6,G     Sea
OL,7,     FIt's day one and the cruise begins
OL,8,     Fwith a trip to the ancient Greek
OL,9,     Fcity of Athens, including a visit
OL,10,     Fto the ruins of Hadrian's Library.
OL,11,G1130 Cruising with Susan Calman
OL,12,     FSusan takes a dream cruise in
OL,13,     FAustralia, beginning in Melbourne,
OL,14,     Fwhich she explores by tram. She
OL,15,     Falso spots her first-ever kangaroo
OL,16,     Fin the wild and enjoys a
OL,17,     Fwine-tasting excursion.
